---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms" description="Terms for using the Portico website and software.">
  <article class="legal-page section-light">
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <p class="legal-lead">Use Portico with media and services you are authorized to access.</p>
    <h2>Your server</h2>
    <p>You are responsible for the media, accounts, network access, and server administration under your control. Portico does not provide media, licenses, or permission to access third-party content.</p>
    <h2>Availability</h2>
    <p>Software, hosted services, documentation, and downloads may change as Portico develops. Keep backups of important server data and review release notes before updating a production server.</p>
    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>Do not use Portico to bypass access controls, distribute content unlawfully, attack other systems, or interfere with Portico services.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
